# The builder runs scripts/materialize-production-source.mjs after COPY . . .
# Its deterministic transformations read source-materialization modules and
# regression fixtures under tests/ and backend/**/tests/. Keep those build-time
# inputs in the context. The final runtime stage still copies only the
# materialized backend/shared/config/dist assets, so scripts and tests do not ship.

